{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "380ebfe66d9421e8f29403ca14488a6295c0719db38516ed2369927395b46dbe", "ja": "（リゾート施設でのイベントが無事終わり、\n星梨花達はジャグジーに行っている……）", "zh": "（度假设施的活动顺利结束，星梨花她们去泡按摩浴缸了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "7d2bd9b49fd3c29a697e0f9774be68600a370a003f0b6e3beb411a476707a35f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしました！\nとっても気持ちよかったです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让您久等了！\n感觉特别舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "a79edcc68d61214f59f4383b68af734e5d5347dae201fc98d7dda35f9004392a", "ja": "お風呂あがりの一杯も、すごくおいしくて……♪\n{$P$}さんも、飲んでみてください！", "zh": "洗完澡后喝上一杯，味道也特别好……♪\n{$P$}先生也请尝尝看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1003_p", "source_sha256": "93c66ae16b4b559af01e685db1e3e4a147ec4aa7b1dff9a2cbb40f1f3da88e22", "ja": "え、飲むって……何を飲んだんだ？", "zh": "诶，你说喝……喝的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "48137b66750637ba1f2a39f826318d40545c7f1a292011c83553483dd605d098", "ja": "みんなで牛乳を飲んだんです♪\n亜美さんが、オススメの飲み方を教えてくれて。", "zh": "大家一起喝了牛奶♪\n亚美小姐还教了我们推荐的喝法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "497d488d658cccc6252232358371c9c0387a46589d3c2bad9e3335607eba5445", "ja": "そしたら、すっごくおいしかったんです！\nあれ？　でも、なんであんなにおいしかったのかな？", "zh": "然后，真的特别好喝！\n咦？不过，为什么会那么好喝呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "5d65343634eddf0a3484e12f69552f35a99f4bc70f3761569c09244ae4e6a235", "ja": "ここの牛乳が特別なんでしょうか？\nそれとも、亜美さんに教えてもらったポーズのせい？", "zh": "这里的牛奶很特别吗？\n还是因为亚美教给我的姿势？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d495252e35d2740ff8d028a6dce9977adfa452a41fa24aabff2ddbe1eb68b645", "ja": "それはやっぱり、仕事を頑張ったからじゃないかな？\n仕事上がりの一杯は美味しい、って言うし。", "zh": "我想，果然还是因为努力工作了吧？\n都说工作结束后喝上一杯特别美味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "fb303603e19de2e89bcdd602c017bb27bd929e684e3fdba5a3856eeb4e99563f", "ja": "そっか、なるほど……。\n確かに、今日はみんなで頑張りましたもんね。", "zh": "这样啊，原来如此……  \n确实，今天大家都一起努力了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "411c362f809856c87e97e82a212f41d62bc76b3a44a12a5b6672eae085e28169", "ja": "わたしは、騎馬戦ですぐ落ちちゃいましたけど、\n残った人を一生懸命応援しました！", "zh": "我在骑马战里很快就掉下来了，不过还是拼命为留下来的人加油了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "913b4a1dd997b484f7f6b0b3bafdf5d2432cf0deb27efb0d74104fc7b735c87c", "ja": "でも……次はわたしも、志保さんや\n紗代子さんみたいに、活躍してみたいです。", "zh": "可是……下次我也想像志保姐姐和纱代子姐姐那样，大显身手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ffd5c3417f8478688c067e0b13377d9ce09ace7f48910be8fcf3986eb2aee4ba", "ja": "おっ、燃えているな！　その意気だ。\n頑張ったら、きっとまた美味しい牛乳が飲めるぞ！", "zh": "哦，干劲十足嘛！就是要这样。\n好好努力的话，一定还能喝到美味的牛奶哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "d0dcadf4ac3535ef3323fc3a7f12cb8af7afa80239b1491e23d680ccf892d718", "ja": "はいっ！　ありがとうございます！\nえへへ……♪　あ、そうだ！", "zh": "好的！谢谢您！\n嘿嘿……♪啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "bd83766563c5b692272c200646533173311d5f36641be984e499658dd0ede689", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、お風呂に入ってきたら\nどうですか？　わたし、お留守番してますから。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也去泡个澡怎么样？\n我会留下来看家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2470b37c040f425c530de18c1c5a723dfbaed66e2e091d2b80d00f91a2cae6b2", "ja": "え？　いや、俺はいいよ。\nお風呂は、頑張ったみんなへのご褒美なんだから。", "zh": "咦？不用了，我就算了。\n泡澡可是给努力了的大家的奖励。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "c58a2c9ce54dac9c1853afc528911ae3dcd0e3c499ea7c4e2e7675ae822ae941", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんも、今日はずっと\nわたし達のこと、応援してくれてましたから。", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生今天也一直在为我们加油，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0283_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b7622f4638c5b2e5b028b003137fbaff6942cf23099be5dc293855464916f08", "ja": "とってもおいしい、お風呂上がりの一杯が\n飲めると思いますよ！　試してみてください♪", "zh": "我想您一定能喝到洗完澡后特别美味的一杯！请试试看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
